0 + 10/60 = 147/60 = 49/20$. $49/20 + 1/7 = 343/140 + 20/140 = 363/140$. ✓\n\nSo $H_7 = 363/140$ is correct.\n\nThe answer $d = \\frac{\\sqrt{429969}}{140}$ is the exact distance. Let me present this cleanly.\n\nActually, I want to double-check: $429969 = 3 \\times 143323$. $143323 / 331 = 433$. Let me verify: $331 \\times 433 = 331 \\times 400 + 331 \\times 33 = 132400 + 10923 = 143323$. ✓ And $3 \\times 143323 = 429969$. ✓\n\nSo the exact distance is $d = \\dfrac{\\sqrt{429969}}{140}$.\n\nLet me write up the proof.", "tool_calls": [], "created_at": 1787227568}
